I ran Tru64 UNIX v5.1b on my AlphaStation 500au and I could not get 
reliable 100baseT networking from the built in ethernet.  

Here are the built in ethernet settings that did and did not work for me:

    >>> show e*
    >>> set ewa0_mode auto-negotiate  # 100BT Full hangs net
    >>> set ewa0_mode fast            # 100BT Half Hangs net
    >>> set ewa0_mode fastFD          # 100BT Full Hangs net
    >>> set ewa0_mode twisted-pair    #  10BT Half is OK
    >>> set ewa0_mode Full Duplex     #  10BT Full is OK

I ended up installing a DE500 PCI ethernet card to get reliable 
100BaseT.  But even then, it seemed as if I was not able to get really 
good performance, but at least it was reliable.

                                        Bob Harris


